        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Hard Game Please</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your limits in one of the most challenging rage games out there? <strong>One Hard Game Please</strong> takes inspiration from the classic &quot;The World's Hardest Game&quot; but cranks the difficulty up to an entirely new level. With movement that’s as tricky to master as the levels themselves, this game is designed to push even the most skilled players to their breaking point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Movement</strong>: Once you start moving, there's no stopping! Navigate tight spaces and deadly obstacles while bouncing off walls in this fast-paced, reflex-intensive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Death</strong>: Touch anything dangerous, and it’s game over. Respawn at the start of the level and try again—no checkpoints, no mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong>: Clean, minimalist visuals that keep the focus on the action.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Brutal Levels in the Demo</strong>: A taste of the chaos to come. Can you conquer these meticulously crafted levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Levels Planned for Full Release</strong>: Each level more devilishly difficult than the last. Perfect your skills and prove your mastery. (Levels past 50 will come out in waves)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave a real challenge and thrive on skill-based games that test your patience and precision, <strong>One Hard Game Please</strong> is for you. Whether you're a fan of rage games, looking to push your limits, or just want to prove that you're the best, this game will give you exactly what you’re asking for—and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you beat the demo?</strong> Prove it.</p>",
